      <text><![CDATA[<p> \(P(H)={@prob_A@}, P(M)={@prob_B@}, P(P)={@prob_C@}\)</p>
<p>\(P(G|H)={@product_A_1@}, P(G|M)={@product_B_1@}\) and \(P(G|P)={@product_C_1@}\)</p>
<p>\(P(G)={@ta_1@}\)</p>

<p>\(P(H|G)={@ta_2@}\)</p>

<p>\(P(H|G^{\prime})={@ta_3@}\)</p>]]></text>
    </questionnote>
